'''Nord Dagger''' is the seventh, [[Deep North]]-tier one-handed [[Knives|knife]].

* The primary attack is a fast 3-slash combo with 2x damage on the last swing.
* Its secondary attack is a leaping stab with 3x damage.
* It deals 6x damage against [[Creature senses|unalerted]] enemies.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Dagger]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Dagger''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Dagger can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Dagger}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Dagger}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

An upgraded Nord Dagger will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

